<title>USA: Motorola up 1/2 to 49-3/4 after the bell.</title>
<headline>Motorola up 1/2 to 49-3/4 after the bell.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Motorola Inc were up 1/2 to 49-3/4 after hours, traders said.</p>
<p>After the market closed, Motorola reported third quarter earnings of $0.34 a share on sales of $6.5 million, compared to $0.81 a share on sales of $6.9 million the previous third quarter.</p>
<p>Motorola said that its units are continuing to take actions to reduce operating expenses, while the company defers capital expenditures.</p>
<p>The company also said it sees a modest recovery in the semiconductor industry in 1997.</p>
</text>
